WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:14.267
Class: La, la, la, la, la . . .

2
00:00:14.268 --> 00:00:17.874
Mrs. Ling: One more time, boys and girls!

3
00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:22.303
Class: La, la, la, la, la . . .

4
00:00:22.304 --> 00:00:25.103
Sweetie: Tweet, tweet!

5
00:00:25.104 --> 00:00:27.396
Kids: Ha-ha!

6
00:00:27.397 --> 00:00:30.472
Jenna: Sweetie is singing with us!

7
00:00:30.473 --> 00:00:33.556
Mrs. Ling: Yes. He loves to sing.

8
00:00:33.557 --> 00:00:38.266
Coby: I'm glad he lives in the music room.

9
00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:40.806
Mrs. Ling: Me too, Coby.

10
00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:46.362
Sweetie: Tweet, tweet!

11
00:00:46.363 --> 00:00:49.576
Miss Gray: How was my class today, Mrs. Ling?

12
00:00:49.577 --> 00:00:53.014
Mrs. Ling: Wonderful, Miss Gray.

13
00:00:53.015 --> 00:00:56.433
They were so good, they get a star.

14
00:00:56.434 --> 00:01:02.090
Class: Yay!

15
00:01:02.091 --> 00:01:05.504
Mark: Now we have twenty stars!

16
00:01:05.505 --> 00:01:09.331
Coby: Right! We earned a reward!

17
00:01:09.332 --> 00:01:12.556
Jenna: What's it going to be, Miss Gray?

18
00:01:12.557 --> 00:01:15.541
Miss Gray: We'll talk about that back in Room Two.

19
00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.414
Miss Gray: Come on, boys and girls.

20
00:01:17.416 --> 00:01:21.072
Class: Bye, Mrs. Ling! Bye, Sweetie.

21
00:01:21.073 --> 00:01:29.207
See you next week!

22
00:01:29.209 --> 00:01:32.538
Kara: Wow. Twenty stars.

23
00:01:32.539 --> 00:01:35.128
We're an amazing class.

24
00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:40.619
Miss Gray: You're an amazing class, Kara.

25
00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:45.917
Mark: But what's our reward, Miss Gray?

26
00:01:45.918 --> 00:01:50.066
Jenna: Can we have a pizza party?

27
00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:52.784
Coby: Or play basketball?

28
00:01:52.785 --> 00:01:55.919
Mark: Maybe we can watch a movie.

29
00:01:55.921 --> 00:02:00.210
Kara: Hey, I know!

30
00:02:00.211 --> 00:02:03.580
Let's have a Silly Hair day!

31
00:02:03.582 --> 00:02:10.096
Kids: Yeah! Yes!

32
00:02:10.097 --> 00:02:15.472
Jenna: Ugh. Does that have to be our reward?

33
00:02:15.473 --> 00:02:23.594
Miss Gray: No. Raise your hand if you have another idea.

34
00:02:23.595 --> 00:02:26.356
Miss Gray: All our ideas are on the board.

35
00:02:26.357 --> 00:02:33.758
Miss Gray: It's time to vote for your favorite one.

36
00:02:33.759 --> 00:02:38.942
Jenna: Pizza Party!
